# Local data: raw CSV cache, SQLite db, generated reports.
# The leading slash anchors these to the repository root. Without it, git matches
# the pattern at EVERY depth - which silently excluded the whole src/fv/data/
# package from the repo, so a clean clone installed but could not download.
/data/
/reports/
